{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "What each use case needs from a material and how strong/light its three options should be. 'analysis': 'drone' runs the drone load model, 'custom' lets the user place supports and forces, 'none' uses the rule-based tiers. 'material_weights' rank the user's filaments (features are normalized across them). 'safety_targets' are the minimum safety factors of the Light / Balanced / Strong options under the main load case.",
